description	"Rebel SpecForce Demolitions

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- Golan Arms FC1 Flechette Weapon (2)
- PLX-1 Rocket Launcher (7 Rockets)
- 2 Frag Grenades

^6Inventory:
- Medpac (25HP+)

Rebel demolition or Plex troopers were specialized heavy weapons specialists in the Rebel Alliance's SpecForces. They used heavy weapons such as the PLX-1 launcher to destroy enemy air and ground vehicles. Due to their heavier armor, Plex Troopers were usually the slower-moving infantry on the battlefield. This was partially compensated by their heavy arsenals. Some were even seen in the Yavin Base before the Battle of Yavin waving Launch Rod Lights. "